Third-party material

This license covers the code, documentation, notebooks and interactive
modules written for this repository. It does not cover:

- interactive/data/fnirs-luke-tapping.js: results derived from "fNIRS Finger
  Tapping Data in BIDS Format" by Robert Luke and David McAlpine
  (doi:10.5281/zenodo.5529797), distributed under the terms of its Zenodo
  record. Cite the DOI when reusing it.
- extensions/fnirs-cedalion/fnirs_finger_tapping.py adapts tutorials from
  Cedalion (https://github.com/ibs-lab/cedalion), Copyright 2024-2025 The
  Cedalion Developers, MIT License.
- Datasets downloaded at run time (for example the IBS Lab finger-tapping
  HD-DOT data used by the fNIRS notebook) keep their own terms and are not
  redistributed here.
